<title>NETHERLANDS: Paccar completes takeover of DAF Trucks.</title>
<headline>Paccar completes takeover of DAF Trucks.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S truck-maker Paccar Inc . has completed its friendly 933 million guilder takeover of the Netherlands' DAF Trucks NV, by acquiring 100 percent of the shares, DAF Trucks said on Friday.</p>
</text>
